 "The old quarter along Bang Phra Canal and the islands of Koh Chang and Koh Kood have cafes and coffee shops with sea views to sit and take a break.",
 "The old quarter by the Chao Phraya, with Wat Phra Kaew, the Gran",
 "The old quarter by the Chao Phraya, with Wat Phra Kaew, the Grand Palace, Wat Pho, and Wat Arun all close together — easily a full day of walking",
 "The old seaside quarter at Bophut, with old wooden buildings, be",
 "The old seaside quarter at Bophut, with old wooden buildings, beachfront restaurants, cafes, and an evening market for eating and shopping. The vibe is more laid-back than Chaweng.",
