 "The small riverside town of Mae Klong, where three waters meet — home to the Maeklong Railway Market, Amphawa Floating Market, and coconut groves everywhere",
 "The southernmost district of the province, still quiet, with Ban",
 "The southernmost district of the province, still quiet, with Ban Krut Beach, Mae Ramphueng Beach, and Koh Talu for diving. It's the stretch of coast that hasn't gotten crowded yet.",
