 "With its crowd of health-minded travelers, Pai has plenty of vegan spots, smoothie bowls, and clean food — handy for long-stay guests and the wellness crowd.",
 "With its European-resort feel, Khao Yai has plenty of good pizza, pasta, and European restaurants, especially around Palio and the resort developments.",
 "With its mix of nationalities, Pattaya has serious Korean and Japanese food districts — barbecue, ramen, and good sushi at several spots, especially around Central and Jomtien.",
 "With lots of foreign visitors, Samui has solid Italian, French, Indian, and Mediterranean restaurants, especially around Chaweng and Fisherman's Village.",
 "With no busy nightlife, Koh Mak suits anyone who wants to relax",
 "With no busy nightlife, Koh Mak suits anyone who wants to relax slowly — falling asleep to the waves, reading a book, and cycling around at an easy pace.",
 "With roots in the Hokkien Chinese community from the mining era, Phang Nga and Takua Pa have Hokkien stir-fried yellow noodles and morning dim sum shops — steamed buns, dumplings, and kopi coffee.",
 "With so many foreign visitors, the island has Italian, Mexican, Indian, and Mediterranean restaurants to switch things up, especially around Haad Rin and Srithanu.",
 "With the city's Chinese roots, Hat Yai has plenty of Chinese restaurants, dim sum, and banquet spreads — roast duck, crispy pork, and southern-Chinese-style seafood dishes.",
